  - nodeId: answer_3
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: "So according to our Third victim \u201CHomeless Man\u201D"
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_3a
  - nodeId: answer_4
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'Lets end this interrogation here, its clear what scam you have committed. '
    endConversation: 1
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: answer_1a
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'She seemed to have fallen for a financial scam of sorts with her bank
      information compromised.  '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_1b
  - nodeId: answer_1b
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'Now, what''s strange is this line she said:'
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_1c
  - nodeId: answer_1c
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: '"My Son is 12. Why would he ask for my bank account information"'
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_1d
  - nodeId: answer_1d
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'This implies that someone impersonated her son or had at the very least
      threatened her with the false sense of urgency using her son''s information! '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_1e
  - nodeId: answer_1e
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: "\u2026Don't you feel shameful?"
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_1f
  - nodeId: answer_1f
    speaker: Jamal
    line: ...
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: start
  - nodeId: answer_2a
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: "He had leaked the company\u2019s accounting ledgers to the scammer by
      accident. What he said:\r\n"
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_2b
  - nodeId: answer_2b
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: "\u201CHow could I have thought that my Boss would be proactive enough
      to ask for the company accounting ledgers!?!\u201D "
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_2c
  - nodeId: answer_2c
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'This is clearly how he was tricked into sending the information.  '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_2d
  - nodeId: answer_2d
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'The chameleon impersonated his boss, a trusted individual in which the
      employees of the company would let their guard down against.  '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_2e
  - nodeId: answer_2e
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'My, you truly do live up to your title as a chameleon. '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: start
  - nodeId: answer_3a
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'He seemed to have been promised a large quantity of money by depositing
      money through a form. '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_3b
  - nodeId: answer_3b
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'Tempted by the Cash Prize , he even sold his house in such a rush, could
      it have been a limited time deal of sorts? '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_3c
  - nodeId: answer_3c
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'Tempted by the Cash Prize , he even sold his house in such a rush, could
      it have been a limited time deal of sorts? '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_3d
  - nodeId: answer_3d
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'No matter how I look at it, the cash prize mentioned was clearly too good
      to be true. To have fallen for that, he must have had a lot of trust in the
      information provider '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: answer_3e
  - nodeId: answer_3e
    speaker: Detective Racoon
    line: 'You sure do have your ways with words, to get someone to fall for something
      like that. '
    endConversation: 0
    choices: []
